  "title": "Roasted Pork Chops with Tomatoes, Mushrooms, and Garlic Sauce",
  "description": "Tender pork chops are given a flavorful spice rub and roasted with tomatoes and sliced mushrooms.",
  "authors": [
    "SUSHMONGER"
  ],
